A vintage 1970s-style illustration of a penguin wearing a floral apron, standing confidently at a wooden kitchen table cluttered with scattered CDs and floppy disks. The penguin holds a steaming cup of coffee while gazing at an old CRT monitor displaying a colorful desktop interface. Warm amber and orange tones fill the cozy domestic scene, with retro wallpaper featuring geometric patterns in the background. Soft afternoon light streams through a window with lace curtains. On the table, several CD cases are spread out like recipe cards being compared. The overall mood is warm, homey experimentation—someone figuring things out in their personal space. Rendered in muted, slightly faded colors with subtle film grain texture, reminiscent of vintage magazine advertisements or cookbook illustrations from the era.
